{"id":"604026","name":"烤迷你三明治","author":"seiseizhang","authorId":"2304656","desc":"","cover":"images/604026/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"吐司","amount":"5片"}],"sub":[{"name":"芝士片","amount":"5片"},{"name":"火腿片","amount":"5片"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好这些食材。","img":"images/604026/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"吐司片、火腿片（方型）和芝士片都平均切成4片。","img":"images/604026/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"在两片吐司片的一面挤上番茄酱。","img":"images/604026/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"夹入火腿片和芝士片。","img":"images/604026/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡蛋打成蛋液。","img":"images/604026/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将蛋液刷在吐司片上。","img":"images/604026/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"烤箱提前5分钟预热180度，之后放入装有三明治的烤盘，烤10分钟。","img":"images/604026/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"出炉后，装盘即可食用。","img":"images/604026/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}